Changes: removed training-only LoRA, SpecAugment, dropout, dynamic chunk training,
checkpoint training utilities, text normalization and unit construction; restricted
model and feature loading to local files. Preserved encoder gradient flags for inference parity.

lm_decode.py (from asr/lm_decode.py): decode() takes per-frame candidates already pruned to
token_min_logp (ids ascending, argmax fallback) instead of the dense log-prob matrix; contextual
biasing removed; formatting. The prefix beam search and its scoring are unchanged.
